    <unit id="CollapseDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>By default, any number of panels can be expanded at a time. The first panel is expanded in this example.</source>
        <target state="translated">默認情況下，可以同時展開任意數量的面板。本示例中第一個面板處於展開狀態。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
